### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Ruta inexistente → 404
GET http://localhost:3000/no-existe

### Registro de paciente → 201
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "paciente@test.com", "password": "12345678" }

### Mismo email → 409
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "paciente@test.com", "password": "12345678" }

### Datos inválidos → 400 con detalle por campo
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "no-es-email", "password": "123" }

### Intento de registrarse como admin → 201, pero con role "patient"
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "hacker@test.com", "password": "12345678", "role": "admin" }

### Contraseña incorrecta → 401
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "paciente@test.com", "password": "incorrecta" }

### Login correcto → 200 y cookie access_token
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "paciente@test.com", "password": "12345678" }

### Usuario actual (usa la cookie del login) → 200
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### Logout → 204
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/logout

### Después del logout → 401
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### 1. Login como admin
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@clinica.test", "password": "una-contraseña-larga-de-12-o-mas" }

### 2. Crear un médico → 201
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "dra.garay@clinica.test", "password": "12345678", "role": "doctor" }

### 3. Intentar crear un paciente desde aquí → 400 (Invalid role)
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "otro@test.com", "password": "12345678", "role": "patient" }

### 4. Listar todos / solo médicos → 200
GET http://localhost:3000/users

###
GET http://localhost:3000/users?role=doctor

### 5. Desactivar al médico → 200 (copia su id de la respuesta 2)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/01a18450-384b-70d7-93b4-88c288d07375
Content-Type: application/json

{ "active": false }

### 6. PATCH vacío → 400 con formErrors
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/01a18450-384b-70d7-93b4-88c288d07375
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 7. Id inválido → 400
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "active": true }

### 8. Login del médico desactivado → 403 (Account is disabled)
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "dra.garay@clinica.test", "password": "12345678" }

### 9. Login como paciente y probar /users → 403
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "paciente@test.com", "password": "12345678" }

###
GET http://localhost:3000/users